## 📌 Incident Overview

This case study documents the handling of a simulated Microsoft Outlook connectivity incident using ServiceNow.

The objective was to demonstrate the ITIL-aligned incident management lifecycle, including incident creation, categorization, prioritization, assignment, troubleshooting documentation, resolution, and closure.

The exercise was conducted within a ServiceNow Personal Developer Instance to simulate the responsibilities of an IT Service Desk Analyst in an enterprise environment.

**Scope:** This is a ticketing and incident management simulation. The troubleshooting actions represent a sample Outlook support scenario and should not be interpreted as evidence of repairs performed on an actual employee workstation.

